---
// Página de propuesta comercial — noindex,nofollow (nunca indexada pelo Google)
---

<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="es">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex,nofollow">
  <title>Ecosistema Multi-Agente IA · RapiPlaga · IA Operators</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      --bg: #FFFFFF;
      --bg-alt: #F9FAFB;
      --surface: #FFFFFF;
      --primary: #FF6900;
      --primary-soft: #FFF4ED;
      --primary-border: rgba(255, 105, 0, 0.4);
      --text: #111827;
      --text-muted: #6B7280;
      --text-light: #9CA3AF;
      --border: #E5E7EB;
      --risk: #DC2626;
      --risk-bg: #FEF2F2;
      --positive: #16A34A;
      --positive-bg: #F0FDF4;
      --shadow: 0 1px 4px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
      --shadow-md: 0 4px 16px rgba(0,0,0,0.10);
      --radius: 12px;
      --radius-sm: 8px;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
    body { font-family: 'Inter', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', sans-serif; background: var(--bg); color: var(--text); line-height: 1.6; }

    h1 { font-size: clamp(1.8rem, 4vw, 3rem); font-weight: 800; line-height: 1.15; }
    h2 { font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.5vw, 2rem); font-weight: 700; line-height: 1.2; }
    h3 { font-size: 1.15rem; font-weight: 600; }
    h4 { font-size: 1rem; font-weight: 600; }
    p { color: var(--text-muted); }
    strong { color: var(--text); }

    /* NAV */
    .nav {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 100;
      background: #fff;
      border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      padding: 0 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      height: 56px;
      box-shadow: 0 1px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.06);
    }
    .nav-logo { height: 40px; }
    .nav-links { display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; list-style: none; }
    .nav-links a { text-decoration: none; color: var(--text); font-size: 0.82rem; font-weight: 500; transition: color 0.2s; white-space: nowrap; }
    .nav-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }

    /* HERO */
    .hero {
      background-image: url('/propostas/Capa-propostas.png');
      background-size: cover;
      background-position: center;
      color: white;
      padding: 4rem 2rem 0;
      position: relative;
      overflow: hidden;
    }
    .hero::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute;
      inset: 0;
      background: transparent;
      pointer-events: none;
    }
    .hero-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .hero h1 { color: white; margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .hero-subtitle { font-size: 1.1rem; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.85); margin-bottom: 2.5rem; max-width: 720px; }
    .hero-band {
      background: rgba(0,0,0,0.2);
      margin: 0 -2rem;
      padding: 0.85rem 2rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      margin-top: 2rem;
    }
    .hero-band span { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.9); font-size: 0.875rem; }
    .badge-proposal {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.9rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      letter-spacing: 0.06em;
      text-transform: uppercase;
    }

    /* SECTIONS */
    .section { padding: 4rem 2rem; }
    .section-alt { background: var(--bg-alt); }
    .container { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .section-label {
      display: inline-block;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 0.12em;
      color: var(--primary);
      margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
    }
    .section-title { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
    .section-subtitle { color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.97rem; margin-bottom: 2rem; max-width: 720px; }

    /* RESUMEN EJECUTIVO */
    .exec-summary {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
    }
    .exec-quote {
      font-family: Georgia, 'Times New Roman', serif;
      font-size: 1.22rem;
      font-style: italic;
      color: var(--text);
      margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
      line-height: 1.65;
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,105,0,0.2);
      padding-bottom: 1.25rem;
    }
    .exec-bullets { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.6rem; }
    .exec-bullets li { display: flex; align-items: flex-start; gap: 0.6rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-size: 0.95rem; }
    .exec-bullets li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 2px; }

    /* CLIENTE / CONTEXTO */
    .context-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .context-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      padding: 1.75rem;
    }
    .context-card h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.85rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .context-card ul { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; }
    .context-card ul li { display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); align-items: flex-start; }
    .context-card ul li::before { content: '•'; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }
    .context-card p { font-size: 0.9rem; line-height: 1.6; }

    /* RIESGOS / GAP */
    .risk-cards { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; }
    .risk-card {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--risk);
      background: var(--risk-bg);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      padding: 1.25rem 1.75rem;
    }
    .risk-card h4 { color: var(--risk); margin-bottom: 0.35rem; font-size: 1rem; }
    .risk-card p { color: #374151; font-size: 0.9rem; }

    /* MÉTRICAS */
    .metrics-grid {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
      gap: 1rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .metric-card {
      background: white;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-top: 3px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 1.5rem 1rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .metric-number {
      font-size: 3rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      color: var(--primary);
      line-height: 1;
      margin-bottom: 0.4rem;
    }
    .metric-label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); font-weight: 500; line-height: 1.4; }

    /* MÓDULOS */
    .modules-grid { display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1.25rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .module-card {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      padding: 1.75rem 2rem;
      transition: box-shadow 0.2s, border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .module-card:hover { box-shadow: var(--shadow-md); }
    .module-head { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 1rem; margin-bottom: 1rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .module-tag {
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      font-size: 0.72rem;
      font-weight: 800;
      letter-spacing: 0.04em;
      padding: 0.3rem 0.7rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      flex-shrink: 0;
    }
    .module-head h3 { color: var(--text); font-size: 1.15rem; }
    .module-channel { font-size: 0.8rem; color: var(--text-muted); width: 100%; margin-top: -0.5rem; }
    .module-features { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.6rem 1.5rem; }
    .module-features li { display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; font-size: 0.88rem; color: var(--text-muted); align-items: flex-start; }
    .module-features li::before { content: '✓'; color: var(--positive); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* STACK */
    .stack-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin-top: 1.5rem; background: white; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); overflow: hidden; box-shadow: var(--shadow); border: 1px solid var(--border); }
    .stack-table th { text-align: left; padding: 0.8rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.74rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); }
    .stack-table td { padding: 0.8rem 1.25rem; font-size: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text-muted); }
    .stack-table td:first-child { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); white-space: nowrap; }
    .stack-table tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .stack-table tr:hover td { background: var(--primary-soft); }

    /* INVERSIÓN */
    .investment-card {
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .investment-table { width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse; margin: 1rem 0; background: white; border-radius: var(--radius-sm); overflow: hidden; }
    .investment-table th { text-align: left; padding: 0.7rem 1rem; font-size: 0.78rem; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.06em; color: var(--text-muted); background: var(--bg-alt); border-bottom: 2px solid var(--border); }
    .investment-table td { padding: 0.7rem 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border); color: var(--text); }
    .investment-table tbody tr:last-child td { border-bottom: none; }
    .investment-table tr:hover td { background: var(--primary-soft); }
    .investment-table .row-total td { font-weight: 800; background: var(--primary-soft); color: var(--text); border-top: 2px solid var(--primary-border); }
    .investment-table .row-total:hover td { background: var(--primary-soft); }

    .summary-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .summary-card { background: white; border: 1px solid var(--border); border-top: 3px solid var(--primary); border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.25rem 1rem; text-align: center; box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .summary-card .amount { font-size: 1.6rem; font-weight: 800; color: var(--primary); line-height: 1.1; }
    .summary-card .label { font-size: 0.76rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.3rem; }

    .price-note { text-align: left; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 1rem; line-height: 1.6; }
    .payment-milestones {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      gap: 1rem;
      flex-wrap: wrap;
      margin-top: 1.25rem;
    }
    .payment-milestone {
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius-sm);
      padding: 0.85rem 1.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
    }
    .payment-milestone .amount { font-weight: 700; color: var(--text); font-size: 1.1rem; }
    .payment-milestone .label { font-size: 0.78rem; color: var(--text-muted); }
    .payment-arrow { font-size: 1.5rem; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; }

    /* ENTREGABLES — INCLUYE */
    .include-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .include-col { border-radius: var(--radius); padding: 1.75rem; }
    .include-col.yes { background: var(--positive-bg); border-left: 4px solid var(--positive); }
    .include-col.alt { background: var(--primary-soft); border-left: 4px solid var(--primary); }
    .include-col h3 { margin-bottom: 1rem; font-size: 1rem; }
    .include-col.yes h3 { color: var(--positive); }
    .include-col.alt h3 { color: var(--primary); }
    .include-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 0.65rem; }
    .include-list li { display: flex; gap: 0.6rem; font-size: 0.88rem; align-items: flex-start; color: var(--text); }
    .check-yes { color: var(--positive); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }
    .check-alt { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; margin-top: 1px; }

    /* NOTA IA / SOBRE NOSOTROS */
    .ia-note {
      border-left: 4px solid var(--primary);
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      border-radius: 0 var(--radius) var(--radius) 0;
      padding: 2rem 2.5rem;
      margin-top: 1.5rem;
    }
    .ia-note h3 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
    .ia-note p { color: #374151; margin-bottom: 0.75rem; font-size: 0.95rem; line-height: 1.65; }
    .ia-note p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }
    .ia-note .conclusion { color: var(--primary); font-style: italic; font-weight: 500; }

    .spec-list { list-style: none; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 0.65rem 1.5rem; margin-top: 1.25rem; }
    .spec-list li { display: flex; gap: 0.55rem; font-size: 0.9rem; color: #374151; align-items: flex-start; }
    .spec-list li::before { content: '→'; color: var(--primary); font-weight: 700; flex-shrink: 0; }

    /* PRÓXIMOS PASOS / CTA */
    .steps-list { list-style: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 1rem; margin-top: 1.5rem; }
    .step-item {
      display: flex;
      align-items: flex-start;
      gap: 1rem;
      background: white;
      border: 1px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 1.25rem 1.5rem;
      box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      transition: border-color 0.2s;
    }
    .step-item:hover { border-color: var(--primary-border); }
    .step-checkbox { font-size: 1.4rem; color: var(--primary); flex-shrink: 0; line-height: 1.4; }
    .step-content h4 { color: var(--text); margin-bottom: 0.25rem; }
    .step-content p { font-size: 0.88rem; }

    .cta-card {
      background: #111827;
      border-radius: var(--radius);
      padding: 2.5rem;
      text-align: center;
      margin-top: 2rem;
      color: white;
    }
    .cta-card h3 { color: white; font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
    .cta-card p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.75); margin-bottom: 1.5rem; }
    .cta-card .signer { color: var(--primary); font-weight: 600; }
    .cta-buttons { display: flex; gap: 1rem; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .cta-btn {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--primary);
      color: white;
      text-decoration: none;
      font-size: 0.92rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.8rem 1.75rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      transition: transform 0.15s, box-shadow 0.2s;
    }
    .cta-btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); box-shadow: 0 8px 22px rgba(255,105,0,0.35); }
    .cta-btn.outline { background: transparent; border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35); }
    .cta-btn.outline:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); box-shadow: none; }

    .validity-badge {
      display: inline-flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.5rem;
      background: var(--primary-soft);
      color: var(--primary);
      font-size: 0.85rem;
      font-weight: 600;
      padding: 0.55rem 1.5rem;
      border-radius: 999px;
      border: 1px solid var(--primary-border);
      margin-top: 1.75rem;
    }

    /* FOOTER */
    .footer {
      background: #111827;
      color: var(--text-light);
      padding: 3rem 2rem 2rem;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .footer-logo { height: 40px; margin-bottom: 1.25rem; display: inline-block; opacity: 0.9; transition: opacity 0.2s; }
    .footer-logo:hover { opacity: 1; }
    .footer-links { display: flex; gap: 1.75rem; justify-content: center; margin: 0.75rem 0 1.25rem; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .footer-links a { color: var(--text-light); text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.875rem; transition: color 0.2s; }
    .footer-links a:hover { color: var(--primary); }
    .footer-line { width: 40px; height: 2px; background: var(--primary); margin: 0 auto 1rem; border-radius: 2px; }
    .footer-disclaimer { font-size: 0.78rem; color: #4B5563; }

    /* FADE IN */
    .fade-in { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(18px); transition: opacity 0.55s ease, transform 0.55s ease; }
    .fade-in.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }

    /* RESPONSIVE */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
    }
    @media (max-width: 680px) {
      .nav-links { display: none; }
      .metrics-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .summary-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .context-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .include-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .module-features { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .spec-list { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-band { flex-direction: column; align-items: flex-start; }
      .payment-milestones { flex-direction: column; align-items: stretch; }
      .payment-arrow { transform: rotate(90deg); text-align: center; }
      .stack-table { display: block; overflow-x: auto; }
    }

    /* PRINT */
    @media print {
      .nav { position: static; box-shadow: none; }
      .hero { -webkit-print-color-adjust: exact; print-color-adjust: exact; }
      .footer, .cta-card { background: #f3f4f6 !important; }
      .footer *, .cta-card * { color: #374151 !important; }
      .footer-logo { opacity: 1 !important; }
      .fade-in { opacity: 1 !important; transform: none !important; }
      .section { padding: 2rem 1.5rem; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- STICKY NAV -->
<nav class="nav">
  <img src="/propostas/Logo-IAOperators.png" alt="IA Operators" class="nav-logo">
  <ul class="nav-links">
    <li><a href="#contexto">Contexto</a></li>
    <li><a href="#solucion">Solución</a></li>
    <li><a href="#stack">Stack</a></li>
    <li><a href="#inversion">Presupuesto</a></li>
    <li><a href="#entregables">Entregables</a></li>
    <li><a href="#nosotros">Nosotros</a></li>
    <li><a href="#pasos">Siguientes pasos</a></li>
  </ul>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <h1>Ecosistema Multi-Agente IA<br>Automatización Integral</h1>
    <p class="hero-subtitle">RapiPlaga · Control de Plagas en Málaga y la Costa del Sol — Ventas, Marketing y Supervisión 100% autónomos, ejecutados en local sobre Nvidia SPARK DGX</p>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-band">
    <span>IA Operators · Luiz Brazão · Junio 2026 · v1.0</span>
    <span class="badge-proposal">Propuesta Comercial</span>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- RESUMEN EJECUTIVO -->
<section class="section" id="resumen">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">Resumen ejecutivo</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Qué proponemos, y por qué ahora</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">El diseño, desarrollo y despliegue de un ecosistema de agentes IA autónomo, llave en mano, que automatiza la captación, la prospección, la inteligencia competitiva y la supervisión — sin que ningún dato sensible salga del servidor local de RapiPlaga.</p>
    <div class="exec-summary fade-in">
      <p class="exec-quote">"Un lead que llega por WhatsApp a las 22h necesita una respuesta en segundos, no al día siguiente."</p>
      <ul class="exec-bullets">
        <li>5 módulos de agentes IA cubriendo atención al cliente, prospección B2B, inteligencia competitiva, supervisión y un cerebro central RAG</li>
        <li>Procesamiento 100% local en el Nvidia SPARK DGX (128GB) — cumplimiento RGPD y filtrado Lista Robinson incluidos por diseño</li>
        <li>Despliegue llave en mano en 4 semanas: 8.850 € de desarrollo + 900 €/mes de mantenimiento, con 30 días de garantía</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- CONTEXTO Y ANÁLISIS DEL CLIENTE -->
<section class="section section-alt" id="contexto">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="section-label">1 · Contexto y análisis del cliente</span>
    <h2 class="section-title">Construida sobre su negocio real, no sobre una plantilla</h2>
    <p class="section-subtitle">Antes de redactar esta propuesta analizamos el sitio web, la operación y el posicionamiento de RapiPlaga. Estos son los hallazgos relevantes.</p>
    <div class="context-grid fade-in">
      <div class="context-card">
        <h4>🏢 Quiénes son</h4>
        <p>Empresa de control de plagas con sede en Málaga, operando en toda la Costa del Sol: Marbella, Estepona, Fuengirola, Mijas, Torremolinos, Benalmádena, Sotogrande, Vélez-Málaga. Registrada en ROESBA (Nº 1324-AND-750), con más de 12 tipos de plaga cubiertos y enfoque tanto a particulares como B2B (hostelería, turismo, industria alimentaria, inmobiliarias, comunidades, sanidad).</p>
      </div>
      <div class="context-card">
        <h4>📞 Cómo captan hoy</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Formulario de presupuesto en la web</li>
          <li>WhatsApp directo +34 604 88 31 80 (sin chatbot)</li>
          <li>Teléfono fijo +34 951 25 00 52</li>
          <li>Email info@rapiplaga.com</li>
          <li>Facebook y páginas SEO por ciudad</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="context-card">
        <h4>⚠️ Lo que hoy no existe</h4>
        <ul>
          <li>Ninguna automatización de respuestas en WhatsApp</li>
          <li>Ningún sistema de cualificación de leads</li>
          <li>Ningún pipeline de follow-up</li>
          <li>Ningún agente de prospección activa</li>
        </ul>
        <p style="margin-top:0.75rem"><strong>Todos los contactos entrantes se gestionan manualmente.</strong></p>
